{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31293","headline":"宿渔家 · 刘威","name":"宿渔家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹屋清江上，风烟四五家。\n水园分芰叶，邻界认芦花。\n雨到鱼翻浪，洲回鸟傍沙。\n月明何处去，片片席帆斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}